      "widgets_values": [
        "NOTE:\n\nThis is for polishing final videos with low denoise setting. Add the trigger words and visual placement of those characters in the definition in the prompt.\n\nFor final output I actually do not disable Causvid now but set it to 0.25 (or 0.3) I think it improves the end result.\n\nThe result is 16fps polished video clip that should be the final cut before interpolation and upscaling.\n\nTo polish use: denoise 0.1\nTo try to fix edit lines and jagged displacements: denoise 0.2\n\noptimum settings I currently use are:\n\nres: 1024 x 576  \nsteps: 30 Causvid (was 8)\ncfg: 1 (was 2.5)\ndenoise: 0.1\n\ntime: will be done in 10 minutes for 1024 x 576.\n\nand prompt out any issues but otherwise I leave the prompts empty.\n\n"
